A closed fence in a quoted sub-item after a lazy line leaves no paragraph

````
> - a
>   - c
> b
>     ```
>     y
>     ```
flush
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
      <ul>
        <li>c
b
          <pre><code>y
</code></pre>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>flush</p>
````

